h1. PCLM Application Recovery Plan — Confluence SOP (PCLI / PCLD / Remediation)

This SOP provides *execution-ordered recovery matrices* for PCLI, PCLD, and Remediation, followed by a shared-component reference. Each workflow can be investigated independently; shared Lambdas appear at the point they execute.

h2. 1. PCLI — {{bk-pcli-stfn-{env}}}

The *PCLI (Proactive Credit Line Increase) Step Function* processes audience records to validate eligible accounts, apply credit-limit increases and applicable account updates, save processing outcomes, generate letters, and complete reporting, transfer, and archiving. The S3 event and Audience Publisher run before the state machine. Distributed Map items run concurrently; conditional and exception paths appear in the separate table below.

